{"id":"634189","name":"自制黑凉粉","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/634189/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"黑凉粉","amount":"100克"},{"name":"葛粉","amount":"20克"},{"name":"熟白芝麻","amount":"少许"},{"name":"蜂蜜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"凉水","amount":"4斤半"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好黑凉粉。","img":"images/634189/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"黑凉粉和葛粉倒入碗中。","img":"images/634189/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加250克水，搅拌均匀至无颗粒状的干粉。","img":"images/634189/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入大锅中。","img":"images/634189/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入4斤的开水(另起锅烧好开水)，不停的搅拌均匀。","img":"images/634189/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"再次煮开。","img":"images/634189/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入大盘中，晾凉。","img":"images/634189/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"晾凉后，切成2～3cm见方的小块，放入冰箱冷藏2个小时以上。","img":"images/634189/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"凉粉块加冰水、蜂蜜、熟的白芝麻，搅拌均匀即可食用。","img":"images/634189/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/634189/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"夏天解暑的好帮手！冰冰凉凉的。","img":"images/634189/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}